<title>UK: Shell up as ABN AMRO repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Shell up as ABN AMRO repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Shell Transport climbed to a record on Wednesday after brokerage ABN AMRO Hoare Govett reiterated its &quot;buy&quot; recommendation ahead of next week's results, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 1134 GMT, the shares were up 18p to 1081, having reached a peak at 1083 earlier.</p>
<p>The brokerage has a target of 1150p for the shares, dealers said.</p>
<p>The company is set to release its results on February 13.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
